{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{PC Killed Patient}
{1020}{}{PC Doctor}
{1030}{}{PC Regular}
{2000}{}{[Dr.Aaron sorts through a stack of yellowed charts, his pen scratching softly against the paper while the autodoc in the corner hums and clicks through a self-check cycle. The fint smell of antiseptic hangs in the air. Tons of gecko skins and creature parts are lying around labelled with different tags]
Hello there.What do you want? I am very busy right now. }
{2010}{}{I want to return tools.}
{2020}{}{I fixed one of your robots.}
{2030}{}{I'm a doctor. Reporting for duty.}
{2040}{}{I'm from engineering department.}
{2050}{}{I'm from engineering department.}
{2060}{}{I need medical supplies for patients.}
{2070}{}{[Leave]}
{3000}{}{[His eyes snap open, surprise breaking through exhaustion]
Wh-what? You a doctor too, or just know your way around healing powder? Doesn't matter, I'm desperate either way.                                                                         [He gestures toward serveral patients laying on beds set up in the middle of room on army beds]
I've got a whole ward of folks needing treatment. I don't want to waste biogel on everyone when its a valuable resource. We didn't get a huge shipment before the end of it all. , it's very expensive too. So? You willing to lend a hand?}
{3010}{}{I can take care of the patients.}
{3020}{}{[Back]}
{4000}{}{Okay, go have a look at the patients in the ward.}
{4010}{}{On it.}
{4020}{}{One more thing before that...}
{5000}{}{I know that one of the patients died. Don't worry - it's just a part of the job. Just be careful next time.I'll need to go talk to their family. I don't want to be that kind of room call.}
{5010}{}{I will bury him, sorry about that.}
{6000}{}{Hm, so what do you need?}
{6010}{}{I need vitamins.}
{6020}{}{I need vitamins.}
{6030}{}{I need antiseptic.}
{6040}{}{I need antiseptic.}
{6050}{}{I need rubber gloves.}
{6060}{}{I need rubber gloves.}
{6070}{}{I need oxygen mask.}
{6080}{}{I need oxygen mask.}
{6090}{}{I need blood cleaner.}
{6100}{}{I need blood cleaner.}
{6110}{}{I need braces.}
{6120}{}{I need braces.}
{7000}{}{Oh yeah, I need someone to fix our oxygen mask... And someone who can patch up our robots.}
{7010}{}{Let me see the mask.}
{7020}{}{I'll have a look at the robots.}
{8000}{}{Good job with the patient. Here's your reward. Keep it up.}
{8010}{}{Thanks.}
{9000}{}{Glad we can be of service.}
{9010}{}{Thanks.}
{10000}{}{How are the patients?}
{10010}{}{I helped one.}
{10020}{}{I want to return tools.}
{10030}{}{I need medical supplies for patients.}
{10040}{}{I want to talk about something else.}
{10050}{}{I've had enough working with patients for now.}
{11000}{}{Okay, there you go.}
{11010}{}{Thanks.}
{12000}{}{Okay, there you go, but please return it.}
{12010}{}{Thanks.}
{13000}{}{Unfortunately, it's not working. I need someone to repair it.}
{13010}{}{Got it.}
{14000}{}{I need you to prove me that you know your way around patients before I start giving you more supplies.}
{14010}{}{Okay.}
